# Issue #50: saving a Character Mover (with a child) as a component crashed
# the editor (SIGSEGV in CharacterMoverNode_Create) once a node had been
# deleted from the scene - its free slot was read as a node.
wait 5
# A deleted node leaves a free slot in the scene.
click @hier:Asteroid_Delta
key delete
expect node:Asteroid_Delta.exists == false
# A Character Mover with a child.
click @hier.add
type character mover
click @addnode.create
expect node:CharacterMover.type == CharacterMoverNode
key ctrl+a
type particle
key enter
expect node:ParticleEmitter.parent == CharacterMover
# Save it as a component: the subtree is rebuilt as an instance.
click @hier:CharacterMover
rclick @hier:CharacterMover
click @ctx:save-component
expect file:components/CharacterMover.component.json contains "CharacterMoverNode"
expect file:components/CharacterMover.component.json contains "ParticleEmitter"
expect node:CharacterMover.type == CharacterMoverNode
expect node:CharacterMover.children == 1
screenshot saved_as_component
